WEBVTT

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.300
There you go.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.240
Thank you very much.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.470
No problem.

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:41.430
Please take care!

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:48.630
Oh!

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.120
So many people!

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:07.040
Come on, Akari! Hurry!

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:08.810
Coming!

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:44.130
<b>Dark Spot of the Sun</b>

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:51.450
Please place your hand on the Tarot cards

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:53.140
and close your eyes.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:54.000
Okay.

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:03.160
Let's see... The Moon is 
coming up for your past.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.440
It appears you're uncertain about

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:07.290
where your current relationship is going.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.020
That uncertainty has been passed on

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:11.420
to the person you're seeing, 
and they're feeling awkward.

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:13.540
However,

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:20.170
The Moon also strongly represents 
insights, dreams, and imagination.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:23.380
And The Sun has come 
up for your future,

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:25.730
and The Empress for your outcome.

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:27.930
Thank you very much.

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:31.800
No problem at all. Thank you.

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.940
Talk about business being slow...

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.610
No kidding.

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.940
Well, I guess it can't be helped since 
her fortunes are usually correct.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.180
Guess you can't fight genetics.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.180
Fortune-telling abilities are genetic?

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.080
Who knows?

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:49.800
It'd be nice if they were.

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:52.590
I'd like to be like my mom as soon as I can

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:56.410
Being a fortune teller is not a 
stable job at all, though.

00:03:56.410 --> 00:04:00.340
I hope Hinata is okay 
with this up in heaven.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.020
I'm sure she is.

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:04.840
She even left me these 
cards as a keepsake.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:08.970
Hinata always said she 
wanted to help people

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:10.440
with the Tarot cards.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:11.460
Yes.

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:14.850
A lot of people were grateful 
for Hinata's fortune telling.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:18.730
But sometimes, she seemed 
to be suffering.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.490
Really? I never noticed.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:25.330
Do you know something that we don't?

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:28.720
No, I guess that's just how it seemed.

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:30.910
Call it fortune teller's intuition.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:40.340
I should get home. Auntie 
will be worried.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.430
I keep mentioning this, 
but you're more than welcome

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:45.840
to live here like you used to.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.830
It's fine. Everyone is really 
nice to me over there.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:51.720
I'll see you later.

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:12.620
So cute...

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:32.310
Oh...

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:39.270
E-Excuse me. You dropped this.

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:52.890
Thank you very much.

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:54.040
Oh, not at all...

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:04.100
She's so pretty...

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:12.820
Well?

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:14.560
There's no doubt about it.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.560
The Wheel of Fortune 
has started moving.

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:35.700
Fuyuna, help me!

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:51.680
Fuyuna! Help me!

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:55.220
Oh, my. I see your room 
is still a jungle.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:01.230
I'm saved!

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:04.690
Apparently it grew again.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.140
So it seems.

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:07.920
It's grown all the way to my room.

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:12.490
Oh, you're right. I'm sorry!

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:13.970
Want to cut it with these?

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:17.090
No, I'll take care of it later.

00:07:17.090 --> 00:07:19.810
Okay, I'll leave it to 
you, then. It's almost dinner.

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:21.750
Oh, wait!

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:27.600
Open it!

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:29.510
What is it?

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:36.600
Oh, it's so cute.

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:41.080
Isn't it? I found it in 
the shopping district.

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:46.610
How does it look?

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.980
Yeah, it looks great on you!

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:57.870
Akari-chan, how's the 
fortune-telling job going?

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:00.940
It's a lot of fun!

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:03.750
I'm still an apprentice, 
so I can't get paid yet, though.

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:07.000
What's so interesting about 
Tarot cards, anyway?

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:11.550
Oh, everything!

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.860
And there are a lot of theories 
about the origins of Tarot cards.

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:16.220
But the most prominent 
are the cards made

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:21.020
in the beginning of the 15th 
century in Northern Italy.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.500
Though, in my opinion, I'd have to say

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.400
it's either the Egyptian 
or Jewish versions because...

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.020
And that's enough of that.

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:30.150
I swear your obsession with Tarot 
cards is as bad as Hinata's.

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:34.800
Well, I think it's 
good to have a hobby.

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:36.530
What about you, Fuyuna?

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:40.500
I have one, too.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.840
Oh, what is it?

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:43.290
U-Um...

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:47.930
Whatever it is, make sure 
your grades don't slip.

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:48.920
Okay.

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:53.920
Oh, maybe I'll have you tell 
me my fortune, Akari-chan.

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:56.220
Sure, anytime.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:58.050
Maybe I'll ask you to 
tell me mine, too.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:58.930
Of course!

00:08:59.340 --> 00:09:01.840
Do you want me to tell you 
your fortune, too, Fuyuna?

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.780
I-I'm fine.

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:06.460
Thanks for the food.

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:15.570
Oh, by the way, about the 
second anniversary...

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:19.210
It's Sunday this time.

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:20.700
Right around the day she died.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.330
Thank you.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:08.120
I'm handing back the midterm 
results from the other day.

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:17.380
Wow, Fuyuna.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.310
You're first again.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:22.140
The things I just happened to 
study were on it, that's all.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:24.770
Wow, Akari! It's spot on!

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:26.770
Really?

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:28.880
Oh, what?

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:34.910
The Star is showing, 
so I think it'll get even better.

00:10:34.910 --> 00:10:36.930
Thanks! I'll do my best!

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:38.280
Do me, too!

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:41.040
Could you see what's 
for dinner tonight?

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:44.230
I doubt I could.

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:46.160
Find out the test answers.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:48.290
I said I can't!

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.280
Were you up all night researching 
Tarot cards again?

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:00.880
Yeah, I want to know 
everything there is.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:04.900
Do you plan to be a fortune 
teller in the future?

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:07.470
Yeah. I want to help people,

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:09.210
and I really enjoy it.

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:14.150
I don't think things are 
that easy in the world.

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:17.490
I don't think life's 
so simple that you can

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:19.330
just do whatever you'd like.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.120
The people you tell fortunes to will be

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:23.600
grateful if you're correct,

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:25.260
but if you're wrong, they'll be mad.

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:27.170
Humans are selfish,

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:29.710
so who knows if you'll always be able

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:31.050
to help someone.

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:33.330
That's true, but if

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:35.530
that's what I thought before starting,

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:37.300
I wouldn't be able to do anything.

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:43.700
You're really smart, Fuyuna, so 
you can do whatever you want.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:48.000
But I only have the Tarot 
cards my mother left me.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:50.700
E-Even I...

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:55.350
Never mind.

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:05.660
<i>Maybe I said too much.</i>

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:32.540
Akari-chan!

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:36.860
You seem down. What's wrong?

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:38.610
H-Huh? Do I?

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:42.110
Yeah, you're always so bright like the sun.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:45.230
You're always listening to 
other people's problems,

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:48.210
but do you have anyone you can 
talk to about yours?

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:50.120
Oh, that's not true.

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:53.840
Look out!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:56.920
What?!

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:09.010
This is bad...

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:31.680
The Tower...

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:34.540
Collapse, accidents, and trouble...

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:36.430
But depending on how you look at it,

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:37.910
you can overcome the trial

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:39.970
and it'll be the start 
of something new.

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:42.170
What are you trying to predict?

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:45.450
I had quite a scare today,

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:48.500
so I was wondering if 
I had some bad luck.

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:49.840
I see.

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:51.680
It's been dangerous lately.

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:54.530
Speaking of which, there 
was some weird guy

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:56.030
in front of our place the other day.

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:56.690
Huh?

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:00.010
You know, the middle-aged 
guy with the long hair.

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:04.570
He came to ask what he 
could do to get his wife back.

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:06.670
Oh, him.

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:09.220
I told him that it wouldn't happen.

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:10.570
He could be pretty resentful.

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:13.390
We should be careful.

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:15.580
If anything were to happen to Akari,

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:18.480
Hinata would never forgive me.

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.340
Because the sun is bright...

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:31.600
Akari!

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:33.510
You'll be late!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:34.600
Coming!

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:42.610
Sorry I'm late. I'm ready.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:44.750
Come on. Let's go.

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:45.610
Yes.

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:54.700
Hey, Fuyuna, sorry about the oth—

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:07.720
Taiyou Hinata

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.870
Annoying...

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:04.960
Envious...

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:07.760
Why?

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:12.740
<i>I can't...</i>

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:29.710
<i>What is this?</i>

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:35.050
<i>I...</i>

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:52.650
A dream?

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:25.610
Akari! Hurry!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.150
Coming!

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:34.560
Is this okay?

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:36.820
Oh, your ribbon's crooked.

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.510
Shall we go?

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:44.330
Yes.

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:47.830
Taiyou Hinata

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:57.000
Don't worry about Akari.

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:17.800
Thank you, Auntie.

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:20.120
Tell everyone at the 
mansion hi for me.

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:23.120
I will. I'll be off, then.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.630
Kill...

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:49.870
The fire's spreading fast!

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:50.850
We need to hurry with the evacuation!

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:53.330
Where are the people who live here?!

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:55.350
I heard they're still inside.

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:58.490
Hey!

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:09.500
Everyone!

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:20.430
Kill...

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:22.500
Why?

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:25.730
How could you do something so awful?!

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:30.730
No!

00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:00.670
<i>I can't...</i>

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:21.790
Well, not bad for an amateur.

00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:24.790
I'll admit she has power, 
but she's pretty wasteful.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:26.180
If this is how she 
handles being attacked,

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:27.560
I worry for the future.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:29.890
You're strict as ever, Seira.

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:32.990
Um, we should report this soon.

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:34.330
Oh, right.

00:21:45.190 --> 00:21:46.260
Let's go.

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:50.350
Hey, how's it going over there?

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:51.540
We're almost there!

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:03.050
Just like Leguzario said...

00:22:03.490 --> 00:22:06.080
For her to awaken on the anniversary 
of her mother's death...

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:07.300
How ironic.

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:08.050
Indeed.

00:22:08.830 --> 00:22:10.300
All the pieces are together, now.

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:31.740
<b>The Sun gifts all life energy and power,
 as well as the joy of living and vitality,
 and gives a bright future to all.</b>

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:41.390
<b>#19       The Sun</b>

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:28.930
We're the Tendo sisters!

00:23:28.930 --> 00:23:31.290
This card is "The Sun."

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:33.220
It's Akari Onee-tan's card.

00:23:31.740 --> 00:23:35.780
<b>On the other hand, at times,
 it is also a great power that 
dries up water and destroys land,
 and can threaten all life.</b>

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:33.870
It is!

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:37.230
It's as the text says.
 Please learn it!

00:23:35.780 --> 00:23:38.380
<b>If you were to draw this card,
 the energy of light
will work in your favor, 
illuminating everything, 
guiding you to success.</b>

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:38.300
We're cutting corners!

00:23:37.910 --> 00:23:41.390
<b>The Blood-Soaked Future</b>

00:23:38.300 --> 00:23:39.030
We are!

00:23:38.380 --> 00:23:40.960
<b>However, if it is reversed, it symbolizes
 everything in the shadow of the sun.
 It hints that whatever you asked about may
 have a hard time seeing the the light of day.</b>

00:23:39.030 --> 00:23:40.960
See you next time!
